    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx. one thing tho, you mentioned \"obtaining the necessary documents\". can you be more specific about exactly which documents the seller has to provide to us? i don't want any issues at the port when the shipment arrives.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
